ted on the Council Agenda:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "VIII": {"title": "MOTIONS OF\n  WHICH NOTICE IS GIVEN", "number": "VIII", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "IX": {"title": "REPORTS", "number": "IX", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by Councillor J. Helmer", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "Approve clauses 1 to 18, excluding clauses 8, 9, 12 and 13.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "4": {"title": "Strategic Plan for The City of London\n  2015-2019:\u00a0 Proposed Reporting Process and Year One Update", "number": "4", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "5": {"title": "City of London Community Grants Program\n  Proposed Evaluate Criteria and Revised Community Grants Policy and Grant\n  Agreement", "number": "5", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "6": {"title": "London Medical Innovation and\n  Commercialization Network", "number": "6", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "7": {"title": "London Medical Innovation and\n  Commercialization Network Update (Paul Paolatto and Peter White)", "number": "7", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["M. Brown", "M. van Holst", "B. Armstrong", "M. Salih", "J. Helmer", "M. Cassidy", "P. Squire", "P. Hubert", "A. Hopkins", "V. Ridley", "S. Turner", "H.L. Usher", "T. Park", "J. Zaifman (14) RECUSED: J. Morgan (1)"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "10": {"title": "Consideration of Appointments to the\n  County/City Liaison Committee", "number": "10", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "11": {"title": "Confirmation of Appointment to the\n  Outstanding London Ambassador Award Committee", "number": "11", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "14": {"title": "Sarnia Road\n  Improvements Phase 3 - Hyde Park Road to Oakcrossing Gate - Detailed Design\n  -\u00a0 Appointment of Consulting Engineer", "number": "14", "content": [{"string": "That, on the recommendation of the Managing\n  Director, Environmental and Engineering Services and City Engineer, the\n  following actions be taken with respect to the Sarnia Road Improvements Phase\n  3 Project: \n\u00a0\na)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 AECOM\n  Canada Ltd., BE APPOINTED Consulting Engineers to complete the detailed\n  design of the said project in the amount of $170,874.00, excluding H.S.T., in\n  accordance with Section 15.2 (e) of the Procurement of Goods and Services\n  Policy;\n\u00a0\nb)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the\n  financing for this project BE APPROVED as set out in the Sources of Financing\n  Report appended to the staff report dated December 1, 2015, as Appendix A;\n\u00a0\nc)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the\n  Civic Administration BE AUTHORIZED to undertake all the administrative acts\n  that are necessary in connection with this project;\n\u00a0\nd)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the\n  approvals given herein BE CONDITIONAL upon the Corporation entering into a\n  formal contract with the consultant for the work; and,\u00a0 \n\u00a0\ne)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the\n  Mayor and the City Clerk BE AUTHORIZED to execute any contract or other documents,\n  if required, to give effect to these recommendations.\u00a0 (2015-A05)", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "That, on the recommendation of the Managing\n  Director, Environmental and Engineering Services and City Engineer, the\n  following actions be taken with respect to the Veterans Memorial Parkway\n  North Extension from Huron Street to Clarke Road: \n\u00a0\na)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Stantec\n  Consulting Limited BE APPOINTED Consulting Engineers for the detailed design\n  of the said project, in the amount of $408,359.60, excluding H.S.T., in\n  accordance with Section 15.2 (e) of the City of London\u2019s Procurement of Goods\n  and Services Policy;\n\u00a0\nb)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the\n  financing for this project BE APPROVED in accordance with the Sources of\n  Financing Report appended to the staff report dated December 1, 2015, as\n  Appendix A;\n\u00a0\nc)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the\n  Civic Administration BE AUTHORIZED to undertake all the administrative acts\n  that are necessary in connection with this project;\n\u00a0\nd)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the\n  approvals given herein BE CONDITIONAL upon the Corporation entering into a\n  formal contract with the Consultant for the work; and,\u00a0 \n\u00a0\ne)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the\n  Mayor and the City Clerk BE AUTHORIZED to execute any contract or other\n  documents, if required, to give effect to these recommendations.\u00a0 (2015-A05)", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "16": {"title": "Kindness Meters", "number": "16", "content": [{"string": "That, on the recommendation of the Managing\n  Director, Development and Compliance Services, the Civic Administration BE\n  DIRECTED to dispose of 5 surplus parking meters, at no cost to Downtown\n  London, for the sole purpose of implementing Kindness Meters as a pilot\n  program; it being noted that the disposition is in accordance with Section 7.\n  b. iv. of Schedule \u201cE\u201d of the City of London\u2019s Procurement of Goods and\n  Services Policy.\u00a0 (2015-T02)", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "17": {"title": "9th Report of the\n  Cycling Advisory Committee", "number": "17", "content": [{"string": "That the 9th Report of the Cycling Advisory\n  Committee, from its meeting held on October 22, 2015, BE RECEIVED.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "18": {"title": "Deferred Matters\n  List", "number": "18", "content": [{"string": "That the Civic Works Committee Deferred\n  Matters List, as at November 10, 2015, BE RECEIVED.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "8": {"title": "Public Participation Meeting \u2013 2016 Water\n  and Wastewater Rates", "number": "8", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "9": {"title": "Small City Strategy Terms of Reference", "number": "9", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "12": {"title": "8th Report of the Governance\n  Working Group", "number": "12", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "13": {"title": "Request for Delegation Status \u2013 Expansion\n  of London Optimist Sports Centre (BMO Centre)", "number": "13", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["M. Brown", "M. van Holst", "B. Armstrong", "M. Salih", "M. Cassidy", "P. Squire", "J. Morgan", "P. Hubert", "V. Ridley", "S. Turner", "H.L. Usher", "T. Park", "J. Zaifman (13)"]}, {"vote": "Nays:", "voters": ["J. Helmer", "A. Hopkins (2)"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by Councillor V. Ridley", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by Councillor A. Hopkins", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "Approve that Council recess.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by Councillor J. Morgan", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "Approve that, as a procedural matter pursuant to Section 239 (6) of the\n  Municipal Act, 2001, the following recommendation be forwarded to City\n  Council for deliberation and a vote in public session:\n\u00a0\nThat, on the recommendation of the Managing\n  Director, Corporate Services and City Treasurer, Chief Financial Officer,\n  with the concurrence of the Managing Director, Environmental and Engineering\n  Services and City Engineer, on the advice of the Manager of Realty Services,\n  the following actions be taken with respect to the property at 3713 Scotland\n  Drive:\n\u00a0\na)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the\n  offer submitted by Ashley Hennessy and Suzanne Hennessy to sell to the City\n  the property municipally known as 3713 Scotland Drive, located on the south\n  side of Scotland Drive, further described as Part of North \u00bd Lot 19\n  Concession 6, Designated as Part 7, Reference Plan 33R1297, containing an\n  area of approximately 18.5 hectares (45.8 acres), for the purpose of\n  buffering the City\u2019s W12A landfill site, for the sum of $756,000.00, BE\n  ACCEPTED SUBJECT TO the City agreeing to pay the Vendor\u2019s reasonable legal\n  fees, including fees, disbursements and applicable taxes, to complete this\n  transaction, subject to assessment; and\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \nb)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the\n  financing for this acquisition BE APPROVED as set out in the \u00a0 Source of\n  Financing Report attached hereto as Appendix \u201cA\u201d.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["M. Brown", "M. van Holst", "B. Armstrong", "M. Salih", "J. Helmer", "M. Cassidy", "P. Squire", "J. Morgan", "A. Hopkins", "V. Ridley", "S. Turner", "H.L. Usher", "T. Park", "J. Zaifman (14)"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "